                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ee6073ec-4cfe-39b5-ac70-c93136fe6cf1",
                        "entry_id": "e68f3f0e-449d-3706-9a4d-21aa78394e0c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство по значению прилагательного давний, отдалённость во времени какого-либо события в прошлом (часто в коллокации «за давностью лет»)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed300036-d0bd-4546-95fd-e50cb9766ff3",
                                "sense_id": "ee6073ec-4cfe-39b5-ac70-c93136fe6cf1",
                                "text": "Фёдор Павлович не мог указать ему, где похоронил свою вторую супругу, потому что никогда не бывал на её могиле, после того как засыпали гроб, а за давностью лет и совсем запамятовал, где её тогда хоронили.."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c139cb3e-d493-326d-b0fb-3a5014f00462",
                        "entry_id": "e68f3f0e-449d-3706-9a4d-21aa78394e0c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "большой срок существования в прошлом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9984e92-b1e3-4cab-8e11-89237fedcbbd",
                                "sense_id": "c139cb3e-d493-326d-b0fb-3a5014f00462",
                                "text": "Давность рода давала право на уважение; личные достоинства одни ставились ни во что."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "358fb18a-f035-3b36-a20e-87d3fb49c217",
                        "entry_id": "e68f3f0e-449d-3706-9a4d-21aa78394e0c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "юр. период времени, по истечении которого приобретается или теряется какое-либо право, а также меняется характер ответственности (также перен.)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1bf1c05-a1fd-4b21-8f16-60731f867271",
                                "sense_id": "358fb18a-f035-3b36-a20e-87d3fb49c217",
                                "text": "За десятилетнею давностью он как будто потерял права на заботы отца и матери,.."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dd942be-6611-4c7f-854d-91bfa219e402",
                                "sense_id": "358fb18a-f035-3b36-a20e-87d3fb49c217",
                                "text": "Проступок Орфея смертелен и неподсуден, притом что не имеет срока давности."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df0b7b67-8624-451b-8a42-b00836dafa73",
                        "source_entry_id": "e68f3f0e-449d-3706-9a4d-21aa78394e0c",
                        "source_sense_description": "отдаленность во времени",
                        "target_lang_word": "remoteness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "remoteness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "725f511c-8767-3694-9e1f-efdbfac40b06",
                                        "entry_id": "a3692e27-91d6-3b9e-9aa9-99aacb759e84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being remote."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3678f6b7-8308-4440-a798-51a47948a91e",
                                                "sense_id": "725f511c-8767-3694-9e1f-efdbfac40b06",
                                                "text": "Then again there was a period of what is sometimes called Euhemerism - the theory that the gods and goddesses had actually once been men and women, historical characters round whom a halo of romance and remoteness had gathered."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c592d1e1-623f-4003-9f75-616bc3841ee6",
                        "source_entry_id": "e68f3f0e-449d-3706-9a4d-21aa78394e0c",
                        "source_sense_description": "отдаленность во времени",
                        "target_lang_word": "antiquity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "antiquity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "796e04b4-2103-3fbb-8aaa-25c09cbdd43c",
                                        "entry_id": "b68bc13c-58ec-3820-a1e5-cb3c874c1915",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ancient times; faraway history; former ages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f19acc04-402c-4f7a-a08c-a1c0d3abc53f",
                                                "sense_id": "796e04b4-2103-3fbb-8aaa-25c09cbdd43c",
                                                "text": "Cicero was an eloquent orator of antiquity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e71fb551-f4c6-332b-81d1-4bdd50014303",
                                        "entry_id": "b68bc13c-58ec-3820-a1e5-cb3c874c1915",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The people of ancient times."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fec299b-4fd6-4147-a4d2-65eef4deb382",
                                                "sense_id": "e71fb551-f4c6-332b-81d1-4bdd50014303",
                                                "text": "That such pillars were raised by Seth all antiquity has avowed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c74476fe-f688-3b21-ad8a-2f6b98928b52",
                                        "entry_id": "b68bc13c-58ec-3820-a1e5-cb3c874c1915",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An old gentleman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b8c507c-44c7-4680-9ed8-9d9bcc8ae5f4",
                                                "sense_id": "c74476fe-f688-3b21-ad8a-2f6b98928b52",
                                                "text": "You are a shrewd antiquity, neighbor Clench."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86191a9a-c976-314d-8111-455a2c0ac4ae",
                                        "entry_id": "b68bc13c-58ec-3820-a1e5-cb3c874c1915",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The historical period preceding the Middle Ages (c. 500-1500), primarily relating to European history."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3896cd0-4d07-3e58-a204-8c25c5c06576",
                                        "entry_id": "b68bc13c-58ec-3820-a1e5-cb3c874c1915",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A relic or monument of ancient times, such as a coin, a statue, etc.; an ancient institution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04a2102b-de00-3096-9e30-839e652922bc",
                                        "entry_id": "b68bc13c-58ec-3820-a1e5-cb3c874c1915",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being ancient or of ancient lineage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ed00668-8d7f-49e3-8167-91a23ae5cfec",
                                                "sense_id": "04a2102b-de00-3096-9e30-839e652922bc",
                                                "text": "He was thinking; but the glory of the song, the swell from the great organ, the clustered lights, […], the height and vastness of this noble fane, its antiquity and its strength—all these things seemed to have their part as causes of the thrilling emotion that accompanied his thoughts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4468b600-9443-4d7f-aa3f-06b51261c36c",
                        "source_entry_id": "e68f3f0e-449d-3706-9a4d-21aa78394e0c",
